<title>USA: Bay View Capital sets split, changes symbol.</title>
<headline>Bay View Capital sets split, changes symbol.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay View Capital Corp said it would effect a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend would be payable on June 2 to stockholders of record at the close of business on May 9, the company said.</p>
<p>The company also said it was changing its stock symbol to BVCC.O from effective May 1, in conjunction with the name change of its Bay View Federal Bank to Bay View Bank.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
